@startuml baseline-architecture
title Current State (Baseline) — Pre-Fabric

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Personal PC" {
  [Windows Task Scheduler] as Scheduler
  [Python ETL\n(etl_master.py)] as ETL
  [obras_report.py] as ObrasReport
}

database "Google Sheets\n(Despesas_Reais_DB)" as Sheets
folder "Google Drive\n(Budget_*.xlsx)" as Drive
database "SQL Server (local)\nstg / dw / dbo (views)" as SQLServer
queue "Telegram Bot API" as Telegram
cloud "SMTP (Email)" as SMTP
[Power BI\n(Import mode)] as PBI
[Power BI REST API\n+ Service Principal\n+ 15-min polling] as PBIRefresh

Scheduler --> ETL : triggers (.bat)
Sheets --> ETL : full sheet read
Drive --> ETL : xlsx read (2x per run)
ETL --> SQLServer : stg -> dw (stored procedures)
ETL --> Telegram : batched notification\n(before SQL commit)
ETL --> ObrasReport : triggers if Obras rows found
ObrasReport --> Drive : saves PDF/Excel
ObrasReport --> SMTP : sends email
SQLServer --> PBI : dbo.vw_* views
ETL --> PBIRefresh : triggers refresh
PBIRefresh --> PBI : forces Import refresh

note right of ETL
  Monolithic script.
  No logging/retry/alerting.
  Only runs while the PC is on.
end note

@enduml
